<title>DUBAI: Yemen oil product exports unaffected.</title>
<headline>Yemen oil product exports unaffected.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen's exports of refined oil products from its Aden plant are running normally despite a fire close to one of the three pipelines that link the refinery to Aden port, a source at the Aden refinery said on Monday.</p>
<p>A fire of burning rubbish close to one of the lines had been extinguished by the refinery's fire department and product exports were running normally, the source said.</p>
<p>&quot;Everything is normal, intact,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>Eyewitnesses in Aden on Monday had said that a fire had struck a 35-km (22 mile) pipeline carrying bunker fuel from the refinery to Aden port.</p>
<p>--Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
